  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective measures implemented by constituents to improve business environment and support sustainable enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO supports the ongoing regional and social dialogue to enhance economic and green jobs-just transition aspects of human security in Syunik region of Armenia, with a focus on promoting local development through enterprise development in community development planning and policy.  ILO supports enhancement of the local analytical, planning and execution capacity to promote social dialogue and multi-stakeholder dialogue for Human Security and bolster income generation activities, green job creation and green entrepreneurship (including women leadership).</narrative>
  </description>
